#: cmdline/apt-cdrom.cc:179
msgid ""
"No CD-ROM could be auto-detected or found using the default mount point.\n"
"You may try the --cdrom option to set the CD-ROM mount point.\n"
"See 'man apt-cdrom' for more information about the CD-ROM auto-detection and "
"mount point."
msgstr ""
"Nijedan CD-ROM se ne može automatski otkriti ili pronaći koristeći zadane "
"točke montiranja.\n"
"Možete pokušati s --cdrom mogućnosti za postavljanje točka montiranja CD-ROM-"
"a.\n"
"Pogledajte 'man apt-cdrom' za više informacija o automatskom otkrivanju i "
"točkama montiranja CD-ROM-a."

#: cmdline/apt-cdrom.cc:183
msgid "Repeat this process for the rest of the CDs in your set."
msgstr "Ponovite ovaj postupak za preostale CD-e."

#: cmdline/apt-cdrom.cc:208
msgid ""
"Usage: apt-cdrom [options] command\n"
"\n"
"apt-cdrom is used to add CDROM's, USB flashdrives and other removable\n"
"media types as package sources to APT. The mount point and device\n"
"information is taken from apt.conf(5), udev(7) and fstab(5).\n"
msgstr ""
"Upotreba: apt-cdrom [mogućnosti] naredba\n"
"\n"
"apt-cdrom se koristi za dodavanje CDROM-ova, USB uređaja i ostalih "
"prijenosnih\n"
"vrsta medija poput izvora paketa u APT. Točka montiranja i informacije\n"
"uređaja preuzeti su iz apt.conf(5), udev(7) i fstab(5).\n"

